  "level": "- **L4**: timeout + retry loop with backoff.\n- **L5**: breaker state machine with thread-safe transitions, composable decorators with justified order, idempotency, jitter, fake-clock tests.\n- **L6**: retry budgets, hedging, adaptive concurrency limits, per-dependency observability.",
